WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:03.430
"Keep Out"

00:03.430 --> 00:04.920
Chiyori-<i>san...</i>

00:08.670 --> 00:10.260
Chiyori-<i>san.</i>

00:11.540 --> 00:13.700
Ah, she's awake!

00:14.910 --> 00:17.210
Wh-Who are you?!

00:17.210 --> 00:18.550
Huh? Well, um...

00:18.550 --> 00:21.950
Is this like some sort of religious soliciting?!
Or an offer for a pyramid scheme?!

00:21.950 --> 00:23.690
Chiyori's got no money!

00:23.690 --> 00:24.780
Um!

00:27.360 --> 00:32.260
If you'd like... could you be friends with us?

00:33.260 --> 00:34.560
Huh?

00:38.800 --> 00:41.800
--This has got to be a trick!
--N-No...

00:41.800 --> 00:46.440
--Like, there's no way anyone would want to be friends with Chiyori!
--You've got it wrong. We really want to...

00:46.440 --> 00:49.100
They're gonna strip me of everything I've got!

00:52.150 --> 00:54.450
Sorry about that...

00:56.280 --> 01:00.120
I'm sorry... I guess she didn't trust us.

01:00.120 --> 01:04.130
She just got confused being suddenly approached in a friendly manner.

01:04.130 --> 01:10.270
She'll probably say something like, "I want to be your friend-y," when you meet her again.

01:10.270 --> 01:12.830
Th-That's embarrassing me...

01:12.830 --> 01:13.800
Huh?

01:13.800 --> 01:17.770
Well, when that happens, please be friendly with her.

01:17.770 --> 01:18.970
Here... I go!

01:18.970 --> 01:19.810
Wha...?!

01:19.810 --> 01:21.780
And... Out!

01:21.780 --> 01:24.640
Th-That's how you get out of the card?!

01:26.110 --> 01:28.610
Well then, take care!

01:29.620 --> 01:30.680
Um...

01:35.590 --> 01:36.750
Huh?

01:39.860 --> 01:41.860
Eldora...

01:41.860 --> 01:45.630
Eldora's so kind, doing all that for Chiyori-<i>san...</i>

01:45.630 --> 01:47.500
It's not only Eldora.

01:47.500 --> 01:50.270
Yuzuki went through a lot for me, too.

01:50.270 --> 01:51.770
Stop it...

01:51.770 --> 01:55.340
Plus, it isn't only me, too...

01:55.340 --> 01:59.950
At first, I thought I was tricked, but...

01:59.950 --> 02:04.020
...all the LRIGs are like any other girl.

02:04.020 --> 02:07.180
I'm sure they're all hurt...

02:09.060 --> 02:10.790
Midoriko...

02:10.790 --> 02:17.970
I'm sure all the girls in the
Selector battles are hurt.

02:17.970 --> 02:19.200
No.

02:20.500 --> 02:24.240
Mayu is the only one different from any other girl.

02:24.240 --> 02:28.040
That's why she longs for other girls...

02:28.040 --> 02:31.580
...and tries to break those very girls' wishes.

02:31.580 --> 02:32.850
Ruko.

02:32.850 --> 02:35.850
Take me...

02:35.850 --> 02:37.250
...to Urith.

02:55.600 --> 02:57.110
<i>Taken and granted,</i>

02:57.110 --> 03:01.110
<i>ideals are repetitious games that slip through</i>

03:01.110 --> 03:03.880
<i>My daily life is so shot with holes</i>

03:03.880 --> 03:06.750
<i>that I can barely stand</i>

03:06.750 --> 03:08.050
<i>Empty theories without conclusions</i>

03:08.050 --> 03:12.220
<i>Dance steps along invisible rules</i>

03:12.220 --> 03:17.260
<i>The final bell holding together</i> <i>the crumbling day rings</i>

03:17.260 --> 03:21.700
<i>In the scene I imagine</i>

03:21.700 --> 03:24.300
<i>you're there</i>

03:24.300 --> 03:27.100
<i>with a smile</i>

03:27.100 --> 03:32.610
<i>No forgiveness? No desires?</i>

03:32.610 --> 03:36.070
<i>And still</i>

03:37.710 --> 03:40.920
<i>We cry "OPEN"</i>

03:40.920 --> 03:45.150
<i>A future to get back and a world to destroy</i>

03:45.150 --> 03:47.590
<i>A wish to open. GOT IT?</i>

03:47.590 --> 03:49.260
<i>Now cross</i>

03:49.260 --> 03:51.930
<i>I wish you don't cry</i>

03:51.930 --> 03:58.930
<i>The future of light and dark,</i> <i>let's believe in the "future"</i>

03:58.930 --> 04:05.500
<i>so that they overlap to gain color again</i>

04:13.780 --> 04:15.270
Come on in.

04:20.460 --> 04:25.660
This place will be given to me as my room...

04:25.660 --> 04:30.330
We fought against Ruko in this very building.

04:33.840 --> 04:37.830
She was... very beautiful.

04:41.010 --> 04:46.780
On the other hand, you really are lacking.

04:46.780 --> 04:51.320
The likes of you can't kill anyone.

04:51.320 --> 04:52.890
What...?

04:52.890 --> 04:56.160
You remember what you said?

04:56.160 --> 05:01.990
Her wish... Her life...
You reaped them away from her...

05:07.300 --> 05:10.000
You really are simple, aren't you?

05:10.000 --> 05:10.670
That girl--

05:10.670 --> 05:12.540
I don't care.

05:12.540 --> 05:17.550
I really don't care whether she's alive or not...

05:17.550 --> 05:21.520
It's just that I was different back then...

05:21.520 --> 05:23.920
Why...?!

05:23.920 --> 05:25.680
This...

05:27.660 --> 05:30.160
...isn't my face...

05:30.160 --> 05:32.350
What are you saying?

05:34.500 --> 05:38.170
You're just back to what you looked like before.

05:38.170 --> 05:41.000
You're more unsightly than everyone there is.

05:43.340 --> 05:47.040
You're filthy from the bottom of your soul...

05:51.580 --> 05:57.050
She said I was filthy from the bottom of my soul...

05:57.050 --> 05:59.920
That soul...

05:59.920 --> 06:06.190
You reached your hands deep within my very soul to save me.

06:08.360 --> 06:13.270
You seek to see things of beauty being broken.

06:13.270 --> 06:16.970
You seek to see them being dirtied and driven to corruption.

06:16.970 --> 06:19.540
With me already in filth...

06:19.540 --> 06:24.750
...I was merely a pawn to you, so that you could battle Ruko.

06:24.750 --> 06:26.580
How surprising.

06:26.580 --> 06:29.480
I thought you were a bit more stupid, but...

06:29.480 --> 06:32.420
...it looks like you know yourself pretty well.

06:32.420 --> 06:35.460
So, now you want revenge, right?

06:35.460 --> 06:40.460
What kind of revenge do you seek, beating me in a Selector battle?

06:40.460 --> 06:43.970
Do you want to see me in ruin, just like what you sought against Iona?

06:43.970 --> 06:50.000
Or... maybe you want to scar this face just like yours.

06:50.000 --> 06:51.470
I'm gonna...

06:53.170 --> 06:55.140
...heal your scar...

06:56.610 --> 07:02.480
That scar will be a pure and beautiful scar inflicted on you by my love.

07:02.480 --> 07:08.520
That scar will also be healed by my strong love for you.

07:08.520 --> 07:10.630
I'll be an LRIG...

07:10.630 --> 07:13.130
...and once I return to being human...

07:13.130 --> 07:17.370
...I'll first find you, and then scar you.

07:17.370 --> 07:22.600
Then I'll battle again for my wish to heal your scar.

07:24.510 --> 07:30.310
I'll be an LRIG, then a human, then an LRIG again...

07:30.310 --> 07:34.950
...and every single time, from now and beyond...

07:34.950 --> 07:37.650
...your body will...

07:37.650 --> 07:40.320
...with Aoi Akira's love...

07:41.890 --> 07:44.160
Aoi Akira's love...

07:44.160 --> 07:46.160
...will go through you!

07:46.160 --> 07:51.900
Aoi Akira is going to continue circulating through your body!

07:51.900 --> 07:56.740
Your body will never forget me!

08:00.210 --> 08:04.080
You're quite interesting...

08:04.080 --> 08:06.650
Okay, let's battle...

08:06.650 --> 08:10.820
Tama and I are starving...

08:10.820 --> 08:12.250
Ru...

08:12.250 --> 08:13.990
I'm sorry...

08:13.990 --> 08:17.230
In the last battle...

08:17.230 --> 08:23.000
...when the dark entered my stomach, a thought came to Tama's mind.

08:23.000 --> 08:25.500
If that wish could come true...

08:25.500 --> 08:29.600
...Tama would do anything...

08:29.600 --> 08:32.010
...even if...

08:32.010 --> 08:34.740
...I made someone cry.

08:34.740 --> 08:38.340
Here I go, you piece of shit...!

08:42.350 --> 08:43.950
You want to see Iona?

08:43.950 --> 08:47.250
Yes, we really need to speak with her.

08:48.520 --> 08:52.460
Hey, aren't you girls Iona and Akira's friends?

08:52.460 --> 08:53.860
You were here before, right?

08:53.860 --> 08:55.860
Y-Yes!

08:55.860 --> 08:59.200
I guess you haven't heard what happened to Iona.

09:01.070 --> 09:04.610
I can't believe Urith is hospitalized from an accident...

09:04.610 --> 09:07.980
I wonder what happened...

09:07.980 --> 09:10.310
I'm getting bad vibes from it.

09:10.310 --> 09:13.310
Maybe Tama got invol--Wha...?!

09:13.310 --> 09:15.150
What's the matter, Yuzuki?

09:15.150 --> 09:17.550
A battlefield opened up somewhere!

09:17.550 --> 09:18.320
What?

09:18.320 --> 09:20.290
Wh-Who's battling?

09:20.290 --> 09:21.420
Maybe...

09:21.420 --> 09:24.430
Iona, can you tell what's going on?

09:24.430 --> 09:27.130
It's very... unstable.

09:27.130 --> 09:32.570
It's as if the battle itself is... refusing to be seen.

09:32.570 --> 09:33.760
Could it be...?!

09:39.810 --> 09:41.280
Da...

09:41.280 --> 09:44.310
Damn it...!

09:44.310 --> 09:46.300
Tama... Grow.

09:49.150 --> 09:53.520
Ru, don't come to Tama...

09:53.520 --> 09:56.920
Don't see Tama like this...

10:12.040 --> 10:15.780
That shop had a good selection of singles.

10:15.780 --> 10:16.970
Yes...

10:21.120 --> 10:22.280
Yuzuki!

10:24.990 --> 10:26.820
That was close...

10:28.320 --> 10:30.520
Ah, how about we get a drink?

10:32.660 --> 10:34.130
Yuzuki?

10:37.130 --> 10:40.660
Yuzuki, you've been acting strange recently.

10:45.010 --> 10:47.480
You said something similar before.

10:47.480 --> 10:49.240
That I've been acting strange recently.

10:49.240 --> 10:50.180
Huh?

10:50.180 --> 10:52.180
Since when have I acted strange?

10:52.180 --> 10:54.180
A week ago? Two weeks ago?

10:54.180 --> 10:55.150
Yuzuki...

10:55.150 --> 10:58.420
Between the previous me and current me, which do you like better?

10:58.420 --> 11:00.250
What's the matter? Yuzuki?

11:00.250 --> 11:01.690
I'm...

11:13.530 --> 11:16.000
I think it's this way.

11:17.100 --> 11:19.070
Tama!

11:19.070 --> 11:21.080
Ah, wait! I got an email!

11:21.080 --> 11:22.540
Huh? From who?

11:22.540 --> 11:24.510
I don't know the sender...

11:24.510 --> 11:27.750
"If you want to meet Urazoe Iona...

11:27.110 --> 11:29.080
"No Subject"

11:27.110 --> 11:29.080
"If you want to meet Urazoe Iona, head here"

11:27.750 --> 11:29.110
...head here."

11:42.430 --> 11:44.130
Urith...

11:44.130 --> 11:45.600
Urith!

11:48.640 --> 11:50.070
Urith...

11:50.070 --> 11:50.770
Uri...?

11:50.770 --> 11:53.110
Tama... Give me back Tama!

11:53.110 --> 11:55.130
Ta... ma...?

11:57.450 --> 11:59.210
That email was very literal...

11:59.210 --> 12:00.450
Huh?

12:00.450 --> 12:02.480
This girl isn't Urith.

12:02.480 --> 12:03.580
She's Urazoe Iona.

12:03.580 --> 12:05.390
What...?

12:05.390 --> 12:11.960
That means this is the real Urazoe Iona-<i>san,</i> and not someone using her body?

12:11.960 --> 12:13.290
Lrig...

12:19.570 --> 12:22.470
It's been a while hasn't it, Lrig?

12:22.470 --> 12:27.010
So... I see you look just like me now.

12:27.010 --> 12:27.980
Huh?

12:27.980 --> 12:30.280
Lrig...?

12:30.280 --> 12:33.740
That's what I called her by.

12:36.350 --> 12:37.920
LRIG.

12:37.920 --> 12:41.290
Lrig? That's your name?

12:41.290 --> 12:45.260
That's not quite true, but I don't have a name, so that will do.

12:45.260 --> 12:46.630
Such a strange girl...

12:46.630 --> 12:49.130
What's your wish?

12:49.130 --> 12:50.660
Wish?

12:52.470 --> 12:54.270
Let me see...

12:54.270 --> 12:57.970
I guess... I don't want to be Urazoe Iona anymore.

13:03.810 --> 13:06.010
Back then...

13:06.010 --> 13:08.780
...everyone around me had expectations...

13:08.780 --> 13:14.860
...of me as the successor to the Urazoe Family, and as an up-and-coming model.

13:14.860 --> 13:17.150
I had very little room to myself.

13:19.860 --> 13:22.660
Lrig didn't really speak much...

13:22.660 --> 13:25.130
...and I didn't ask her much, either.

13:25.130 --> 13:30.470
Amid all the involvement I had with others, it was a bit relaxing...

13:33.140 --> 13:36.130
I battled alongside Lrig...

13:38.010 --> 13:39.570
...and then...

13:42.880 --> 13:45.320
...an Eternal Girl was born.

13:46.890 --> 13:50.930
I went to Mayu, and found out all of what happened.

13:50.930 --> 13:55.400
Do you understand now what
Selector battles are about?

13:55.400 --> 13:57.670
Are you upset?

13:57.670 --> 14:03.200
But, all you need to do is to become an LRIG and drag a Selector into battle, then...

14:04.540 --> 14:07.340
It doesn't matter.

14:07.340 --> 14:11.380
My wish to not be Urazoe Iona came true.

14:11.380 --> 14:14.950
There's no reason for me to battle anymore.

14:14.950 --> 14:19.550
So... you don't care about being human again?

14:19.550 --> 14:22.420
Everything will end...
Are you okay with that?

14:22.420 --> 14:24.430
Yes, I'm fine.

14:24.430 --> 14:26.590
What...? That's wrong...

14:26.590 --> 14:27.230
What?

14:27.230 --> 14:29.200
That's absolutely wrong!

14:29.200 --> 14:31.200
Say that this is terrible...

14:31.200 --> 14:33.930
Say that you want to be human again no matter what!

14:33.930 --> 14:36.070
Wail and scream with tears!

14:36.070 --> 14:39.800
Otherwise, that's absolutely and completely wrong!

14:40.770 --> 14:44.400
And then... I became an LRIG.

14:45.580 --> 14:49.080
I was an LRIG for two other Selectors...

14:49.080 --> 14:52.390
...but I didn't coerce my Selectors into battle.

14:52.390 --> 14:53.580
But...

14:54.920 --> 14:59.380
...if you think about how your wish can come true, you start wanting to battle.

15:00.390 --> 15:06.800
But, the Selectors I was with weren't suited to doing battle.

15:06.800 --> 15:10.640
They lost their battles and their wishes were reversed...

15:10.640 --> 15:15.910
I think that girl, Mayu, didn't like me.

15:15.910 --> 15:19.610
That's why I think she purposely assigned me as an LRIG to weaker girls.

15:19.610 --> 15:20.950
That's not...

15:20.950 --> 15:27.920
I didn't think much about myself and of others, but...

15:27.920 --> 15:33.090
...with all the tears I've seen, it became hard to bear...

15:33.090 --> 15:37.670
That's when I felt my real body...

15:37.670 --> 15:41.340
...Urazoe Iona, become hollow.

15:41.340 --> 15:43.270
Hollow...?

15:43.270 --> 15:47.440
I immediately thought to myself that I needed to go back.

15:47.440 --> 15:52.950
If no one resided within Urazoe Iona's body, everything would truly end.

15:52.950 --> 15:57.120
I see. Urith was using Iona-<i>san</i>'s body, so...

15:57.120 --> 16:00.490
...Urith's wish came true, and an Eternal Girl was born!

16:00.490 --> 16:01.160
That's why...

16:01.160 --> 16:03.790
Wait! But, why hollow?

16:03.790 --> 16:07.330
If Urith became an LRIG, then Tama should be human, right?

16:07.330 --> 16:09.830
And, in Iona-<i>san</i>'s body!

16:09.830 --> 16:11.470
Right, Iona?

16:11.470 --> 16:15.140
Tama... refused.

16:15.140 --> 16:16.360
Refused...?

16:23.210 --> 16:26.310
Why didn't you become Urazoe Iona?

16:26.310 --> 16:30.380
It's wrong that you remain an LRIG, right?

16:30.380 --> 16:31.020
But...

16:31.020 --> 16:34.190
I sensed your feelings, Tama.

16:34.190 --> 16:40.590
A feeling of wanting to eat ice cream together with Ru under the summer sun.

16:40.590 --> 16:43.930
Tama... is originally a card.

16:43.930 --> 16:45.930
I'm not a human...

16:45.930 --> 16:50.100
So, if Tama wanted to be human...

16:50.100 --> 16:53.740
...someone else may become sad and lonely.

16:53.740 --> 16:56.010
Stop making excuses!

16:56.010 --> 17:00.510
I told you I sensed your feelings.
Tama, you also thought...

17:00.510 --> 17:04.690
...that you were fine even if you had to make someone cry, right?!

17:04.690 --> 17:07.450
I didn't want...

17:07.450 --> 17:10.450
...the bad Tama to be seen.

17:12.760 --> 17:15.630
But, I sensed...

17:15.630 --> 17:20.370
I sensed Ru doing her best looking for Tama.

17:20.370 --> 17:24.100
But, Ru can't find Tama...

17:24.100 --> 17:26.440
She'll never find me...

17:26.440 --> 17:31.380
...because the bad Tama isn't the Tama that Ru knows...

17:31.380 --> 17:36.920
That's why, even if Tama became human, Ru can't find me...

17:36.920 --> 17:40.450
Tama can't be friends with Ru...

17:40.450 --> 17:45.760
That's why Tama broke the promise with Ru...!

17:46.930 --> 17:48.260
I●●●

17:48.260 --> 17:53.670
I want... everyone who became LRIGs...

17:53.670 --> 17:56.900
...to be returned to their world!

17:56.900 --> 18:01.440
That's my... one and only wish!

18:01.440 --> 18:03.410
Tama...

18:03.410 --> 18:06.740
...needs to make Ru's wish come true.

18:13.250 --> 18:15.620
Thank you for accompanying me.

18:15.620 --> 18:17.930
I'll take my leave here.

18:17.930 --> 18:19.490
Okay, until next time.

18:19.490 --> 18:21.930
I know it's weird for me to say this, but...

18:21.930 --> 18:25.770
...don't get involved in
Selector battles ever again, okay?

18:25.770 --> 18:27.200
Yes...

18:27.200 --> 18:30.640
Ah, anything to say, Iona?

18:30.640 --> 18:32.940
Take care.

18:32.940 --> 18:38.380
Lrig, you seem a lot different now from when you were with me.

18:40.210 --> 18:42.620
Thank you...

18:42.620 --> 18:43.950
...and, I'm sorry.

18:53.290 --> 18:57.200
Tama is with Mayu...

18:57.200 --> 18:58.190
Yup.

18:59.470 --> 19:03.500
Just when we were thinking of meeting Mayu to speak with her...

19:03.500 --> 19:05.670
There goes that plan.

19:05.670 --> 19:07.710
Why?

19:07.710 --> 19:10.210
I think the only thing that changed was the order.

19:10.210 --> 19:15.220
Our plan was to get a wish while Tama and Mayu are with us.

19:15.220 --> 19:17.480
But now, I just need to win Selector battles,

19:17.480 --> 19:20.420
and become an LRIG to go to the white window room.

19:20.420 --> 19:23.090
To where Mayu and Tama are at.

19:23.090 --> 19:25.890
There I'll speak with Mayu, and once she understands--

19:25.890 --> 19:27.690
No! That's too dangerous!

19:27.690 --> 19:29.430
Like I said, it's only the order that changed.

19:29.430 --> 19:32.200
What are you saying?!
It isn't that simple...!

19:32.200 --> 19:34.940
I'll be with her, so it will be fine.

19:34.940 --> 19:38.040
I'll protect Ru.

19:38.040 --> 19:39.340
Iona...

19:41.710 --> 19:43.210
Ah...!

19:43.210 --> 19:44.180
That's not correct!

19:44.180 --> 19:45.050
Huh?

19:45.050 --> 19:49.450
We were saying "Iona" all along, but that's not her correct name!

19:49.450 --> 19:51.190
Oh, that's right...

19:51.190 --> 19:52.520
I'm fine being called "Iona."

19:52.520 --> 19:53.890
Oh, no!

19:53.890 --> 19:56.960
Let's think of a new name for her!

19:56.960 --> 19:58.220
Okay?

20:00.290 --> 20:02.760
Nice! Let's get thinking!

20:03.860 --> 20:05.130
Um...

20:05.130 --> 20:07.100
Is there any word that you like?

20:07.100 --> 20:11.610
Kind of like how Chiyori was saying she wanted to be an LRIG named "Elizabethan Collar,"

20:11.610 --> 20:12.770
or something.

20:12.770 --> 20:14.770
Like...

20:25.950 --> 20:27.440
Snow...

20:33.490 --> 20:37.430
I liked... snow...

20:39.130 --> 20:41.400
Back in the room where I was with Mayu...

20:41.400 --> 20:42.630
Shut up...

20:45.110 --> 20:48.440
Shut up... Shut up!

20:48.440 --> 20:53.450
Many sounds were heard from the outside, even when I didn't want to hear them.

20:53.450 --> 20:56.110
But, when it snowed...

21:00.990 --> 21:05.190
The snow got rid of all the sounds.

21:05.190 --> 21:07.860
It hid all things.

21:09.860 --> 21:12.530
Cold, yet kind...

21:12.530 --> 21:13.800
...snow...

21:14.970 --> 21:20.210
How about "Yuki," since it means "snow"?

21:20.210 --> 21:24.180
Yuki is perfect! It has that girly, pretty touch to it!

21:24.180 --> 21:27.150
Yup! It even has that "cool" factor to it that matches!

21:27.150 --> 21:29.820
--Yup. That'll make things a lot clearer.

21:27.710 --> 21:29.820
--Yuki...

21:29.820 --> 21:32.020
I'm... Yuki...

21:32.020 --> 21:35.460
I mean, it'll be confusing calling her "Iona" when Urazoe Iona's around.

21:35.460 --> 21:38.390
Aah! I forgot to ask Iona-<i>san...</i>

21:38.390 --> 21:42.400
...about the sender who told us where Iona-<i>san</i> was.

21:42.400 --> 21:43.700
That's right!

21:43.700 --> 21:46.230
Wow, that was stupid of us...

21:46.230 --> 21:47.570
What's the sender's address?

21:47.570 --> 21:51.740
Um, well... "shadow-prince"...?

21:51.740 --> 21:54.710
Anyone know of any "shadow-prince"?

21:58.650 --> 22:01.240
Shadow... prince...

22:01.750 --> 22:03.320
<i>Life...</i>

22:03.320 --> 22:08.760
<i>A city of mazes with no exit</i>

22:04.690 --> 22:06.090
Shiro...

22:06.090 --> 22:07.550
I understand...

22:08.760 --> 22:13.330
<i>and the sound of bells ringing</i>

22:10.390 --> 22:14.430
Kuro is a bad girl, and Shiro is a good girl.

22:13.330 --> 22:14.930
<i>I do...</i>

22:14.430 --> 22:15.930
But...

22:14.930 --> 22:20.500
<i>Leave the "now" handed to me</i>

22:15.930 --> 22:18.530
...Shiro is more spiteful.

22:18.530 --> 22:20.370
Spite... ful...?

22:20.370 --> 22:21.940
Yes.

22:20.500 --> 22:25.210
<i>as I begin to walk in the morning</i>

22:21.940 --> 22:26.240
You're cheerful, happy, and kind...

22:25.210 --> 22:30.680
<i>In a world where light and dark intersect</i>

22:26.240 --> 22:31.280
Girls like you find happiness and leave Mayu behind!

22:30.680 --> 22:36.850
<i>catharsis begins to awake</i>

22:33.950 --> 22:38.450
That's why I had Shiro closed away!

22:36.850 --> 22:41.920
<i>I swore in my shaking heart</i>

22:38.450 --> 22:43.290
I should have known better to have let Shiro go to the outside world!

22:41.920 --> 22:52.090
<i>that I won't lose anyone anymore...!</i>

22:45.590 --> 22:46.960
No!

22:46.960 --> 22:48.860
Ru!

22:48.860 --> 22:52.070
Ruuu...!

22:53.730 --> 22:58.740
<i>Even if my tears flow tomorrow</i>

22:58.740 --> 23:05.450
<i>I'll run through the wind</i>

23:05.450 --> 23:10.480
<i>Release myself towards the future I selected</i>

23:06.450 --> 23:08.450
Kazuki, did you forget something?

23:10.480 --> 23:13.120
<i>to regain it</i>

23:13.120 --> 23:20.250
<i>I won't give up on my wish</i>

23:21.960 --> 23:25.900
"This Warmth Is at Its Limit"

23:26.670 --> 23:28.600
I accept...

23:28.600 --> 23:29.970
You're so stupid...

23:29.970 --> 23:31.610
Now...

23:31.610 --> 23:33.770
...your wish won't come true...

23:33.770 --> 23:34.810
...a new...

23:34.810 --> 23:36.810
Now, let's begin...

23:36.810 --> 23:38.950
Ru... please...

23:38.750 --> 23:40.940
"That Locked Window"

23:38.950 --> 23:40.750
That Locked Window.
